    "header_contract": "Handled partner responses carry server UUID X-Request-ID and no-store; handled 401 carries WWW-Authenticate: Bearer. Error request_id matches header. Gateway/middleware failures may have another envelope.",
    "status_error": "Asynchronous command error is null or {code,message}, without retryable/request_id. Preserve independent status and billing state.",
    "codes_policy": "Documented codes are established observations, not an exhaustive backend error enum."
  },
